{"video":"HWkUfJ03BX8","lines":[{"t":[0,1.7],"en":"Oh, there she is."},{"t":[1.8,3.6],"en":"Oh, she's so beautiful."},{"t":[4.1,4.4],"en":"Oh, dear."},{"t":[5.9,7.3],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[8.4,9.6],"en":"She's amazing."},{"t":[11.2,14.3],"en":"Oh, I'm so glad you guys got drunk and had sex."},{"t":[16.8,17.9],"en":"It's incredible."},{"t":[18.1,19.6],"en":"I mean, one minute she's inside you,"},{"t":[19.6,22.5],"en":"and then 47 hours later, here she is."},{"t":[29.2,30.8],"en":"She looks so real."},{"t":[33.4,34.8],"en":"You know what I mean."},{"t":[35.2,36.3],"en":"Okay, my turn, my turn."},{"t":[37,37.7],"en":"Hey, Phoebe."},{"t":[38.4,39.4],"en":"Oh, baby."},{"t":[39.9,42.5],"en":"Oh, you're so cute."},{"t":[43.1,45.2],"en":"Oh, I could squeeze her little head."},{"t":[48.1,49],"en":"I won't."},{"t":[50.7,51.7],"en":"What's the matter?"},{"t":[52.4,52.8],"en":"Nothing."},{"t":[53.1,55.1],"en":"I'm sorry, I just can't stop crying."},{"t":[55.6,58.4],"en":"The doctor said it's completely normal with all the hormones,"},{"t":[58.4,59.9],"en":"plus you're sleep-deprived."},{"t":[60.1,60.6],"en":"So?"},{"t":[60.8,62.4],"en":"You guys are all sleep-deprived."},{"t":[62.4,63.5],"en":"I don't see you weeping"},{"t":[63.5,65.9],"en":"because you put your slippers on the wrong feet."},{"t":[67.7,69.1],"en":"Oh, gosh."},{"t":[69.7,70.9],"en":"What's the matter now?"},{"t":[71.2,72.8],"en":"I was reliving it."},{"t":[75.3,77],"en":"So, do you know what you're going to call her yet?"},{"t":[77.8,79.2],"en":"Oh, wait a minute."},{"t":[79.3,80.6],"en":"It's not going to be baby girl?"},{"t":[80.9,82.1],"en":"I thought that was so original."},{"t":[85.1,87.4],"en":"Actually, we've narrowed it down to two names."},{"t":[87.7,88.7],"en":"Yeah, and you know what?"},{"t":[88.7,89.7],"en":"I love them both."},{"t":[89.8,92.1],"en":"So, why don't you just pick one, and that'll be it."},{"t":[93.9,98.4],"en":"Well, um, okay, uh, everyone,"},{"t":[98.4,102.5],"en":"this is Isabella."},{"t":[103.2,104.1],"en":"Oh, I love Isabella."},{"t":[104.1,105.1],"en":"Isabella."},{"t":[105.8,106.3],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[111.1,111.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[111.9,113.9],"en":"That's not her name."},{"t":[115.2,116.1],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[116.2,118.1],"en":"She just doesn't feel like an Isabella."},{"t":[118.7,119.8],"en":"What was the other one, Ross?"},{"t":[119.9,121],"en":"Um, Delilah."},{"t":[121.3,122.1],"en":"Oh, great."},{"t":[122.4,124.4],"en":"Suddenly, she sounds like a biblical whore."},{"t":[124.4,131.4],"en":"Uh, so, I guess we're back to, uh, baby girl."},{"t":[131.6,131.9],"en":"Yay!"},{"t":[134.3,135.5],"en":"Well, what are we going to do?"},{"t":[135.7,136.2],"en":"It's okay."},{"t":[136.3,137.3],"en":"Honey, you'll find a name."},{"t":[137.5,139],"en":"Ugh, easy for you to say."},{"t":[139.1,140.9],"en":"You already know what your kids' names are going to be."},{"t":[141.7,142],"en":"You do?"},{"t":[142.9,143.3],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[143.6,145.7],"en":"I've been picked out since I was 14."},{"t":[146.3,146.8],"en":"Oh, no."},{"t":[146.8,149.6],"en":"It's going to be named after some snack or baked good, isn't it?"},{"t":[154.1,155.9],"en":"Well, tell us, what are they?"},{"t":[156.6,159.3],"en":"Um, okay, if it's a boy, it's Daniel."},{"t":[159.7,160.7],"en":"And if it's a girl?"},{"t":[161.6,162.5],"en":"I don't want to say."},{"t":[163.1,164.9],"en":"Oh, don't tell us."},{"t":[165,166.2],"en":"We're not going to want it."},{"t":[167.6,168],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[169.3,170],"en":"It's Emma."},{"t":[171.2,171.6],"en":"Emma."},{"t":[177.2,178.5],"en":"See, I don't want it."},{"t":[183.8,185.2],"en":"Take it."},{"t":[186.4,186.9],"en":"What?"},{"t":[188.1,189.8],"en":"She's clearly an Emma."},{"t":[190.2,192.1],"en":"Oh, honey, but you love that name."},{"t":[193.5,193.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[194.4,195.3],"en":"But I love you more."},{"t":[196.9,197.3],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[198.6,202.1],"en":"Besides, you know, nothing goes with Bing, so I'm screwed."},{"t":[202.1,202.9],"en":"- That's a good episode."}]}
